### 🚨 TRANSLATION FILE STAGING - EXCLUSIVE RESPONSIBILITY

**ONLY translator agent** can stage .po/.pot files:

```bash
# ✅ ONLY translator runs these commands
git add priv/gettext/**/*.po
git add priv/gettext/**/*.pot
git add *.po
```

**ALL other agents** are ABSOLUTELY FORBIDDEN from staging translation files:

- ❌ feature-developer: NEVER stage .po/.pot files
- ❌ verification-engineer: NEVER stage .po/.pot files
- ❌ code-reviewer: NEVER stage .po/.pot files
- ❌ ANY other agent: NEVER stage .po/.pot files

**Why this matters**: `make ci` expects translation files staged ONLY by translator. Other agents staging these files causes CI pipeline failures.

